WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.219 --> 00:00:11.887
[ CHAINS CLINKING]

00:00:11.887 --> 00:00:14.014
[ METAL DOOR SLIDING]

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.520
EDO VOSS:
For hundreds of years,

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.523
the world has been
without sight.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.359
You think because you could see,

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:26.985
that will save you?

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:31.615
HANIWA:
No. My father is Baba Voss.

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:36.745
He will come for me.

00:00:39.248 --> 00:00:40.916
[ SWORD SCRAPING]

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:44.336
-There is no distance too far.
[ SWORD SCRAPING]

00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:47.798
No city too dangerous.

00:00:47.798 --> 00:00:49.424
[ CROWD SHOUTS]

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:51.176
No army too strong.

00:00:53.262 --> 00:00:54.680
He would do anything...

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:58.141
...to protect his family.

00:00:58.141 --> 00:01:01.561
[ CROWD SHOUTING ]

00:01:04.982 --> 00:01:06.566
He will make you pay for this.

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:12.823
EDO VOSS:
I will pay?

00:01:15.534 --> 00:01:19.246
He owes me more than
you could ever imagine.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:26.753
I am Commander General Edo Voss.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.717
♪♪

00:01:38.515 --> 00:01:41.810
It's been a long time,
brother.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.479
♪♪

